[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2476808894","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99239#issuecomment-2476808894","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99239","id":2476808894,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ToRq-","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-14T16:06:25Z","updated_at":"2024-11-14T16:06:25Z","body":"You can just use `IsQueuedForDeletion` to get that status","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2476808894/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2476838723","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99239#issuecomment-2476838723","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99239","id":2476838723,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ToY9D","user":{"login":"Blue-EyesWhiteDragon","id":7526156,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MjYxNTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7526156?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blue-EyesWhiteDragon","html_url":"https://github.com/Blue-EyesWhiteDragon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blue-EyesWhiteDragon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blue-EyesWhiteDragon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blue-EyesWhiteDragon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blue-EyesWhiteDragon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blue-EyesWhiteDragon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blue-EyesWhiteDragon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blue-EyesWhiteDragon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blue-EyesWhiteDragon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blue-EyesWhiteDragon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-14T16:15:50Z","updated_at":"2024-11-14T16:15:50Z","body":"It is queued to be freed from memory. \r\n\"Unlike with [Object.free](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_object.html#class-object-method-free), the node is not deleted instantly, and it can still be accessed before deletion. It is also safe to call [queue_free](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_node.html#class-node-method-queue-free) multiple times. Use [Object.is_queued_for_deletion](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_object.html#class-object-method-is-queued-for-deletion) to check if the node will be deleted at the end of the frame.\" - [Godot Documentation](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_node.html#class-node-method-queue-free)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2476838723/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2476858687","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99239#issuecomment-2476858687","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99239","id":2476858687,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Tod0_","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-14T16:23:31Z","updated_at":"2024-11-14T16:23:31Z","body":"There's a lot of behind the scenes code that depends on the behavior of this, or rather on what `is_instance_valid` checks, so to change this we would either have to make the bound function not work the same way or check for the queued status, or this would break a lot of internal code that is allowed to operate on the object until it is actually freed\r\n\r\nThat's exactly why `queue_free` exists, it's there to not break internal things that might operate on it before the end of the frame, otherwise you'd just use `free`","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2476858687/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3882651667","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99239#issuecomment-3882651667","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99239","id":3882651667,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7nbJAT","user":{"login":"jitspoe","id":7751182,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTExODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7751182?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe","html_url":"https://github.com/jitspoe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-11T06:45:26Z","updated_at":"2026-02-11T06:45:39Z","body":"So this bit me and took a long time to track down since I was assuming something that got queue_free()'d would not be valid (specifically got me really bad because it was framerate dependent and only happened when the framerate dropped below 60 causing multiple updates in a frame).  It might be nice to have a function that checks all of these things if it's necessary to not have is_instance_valid return false for something that is queue_free()'d.  That way we don't have to put `if (is_instance_valid(thing) && !thing.is_queued_for_deletion()): ...` everywhere.\n\nFor now, I'm just calling free() to ensure it's actually invalid as I'm manually cleaning up references to it.  Hopefully that doesn't cause any issues.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3882651667/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]